.el .ds Aq '
.TH dalfox 1  "dalfox 3.2.1"
.SH NAME
dalfox \- Powerful open\-source XSS scanner
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalfox\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-S\fR|\fB\-\-silence\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fITARGET\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Powerful open\-source XSS scanner
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Path to a config file (TOML or JSON). Overrides default search path
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable debug logging (show DBG lines)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colored output (also respects NO_COLOR env var)
.TP
\fB\-S\fR, \fB\-\-silence\fR
Silence all logs except POC output to STDOUT
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fITARGET\fR]
Targets (when no subcommand is provided, defaults to scan)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalfox\-scan(1)
Scan targets for XSS
.TP
dalfox\-server(1)
Run API/server mode
.TP
dalfox\-payload(1)
Manage or enumerate payloads
.TP
dalfox\-mcp(1)
Run MCP stdio server (Model Context Protocol) exposing Dalfox tools
.TP
dalfox\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v3.2.1
